  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Therla Narasimha Prasad vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 21 September, 2020 Author: M.Satyanarayana Murthy Bench: M.Satyanarayana Murthy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice M.Satyanarayana Murthy Criminal Petition No.3906 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "This criminal petition is filed by the petitioners/Accused Nos. 1 & 2 under Section 482 of Criminal Procedure Code (for short \"Cr.P.C.\") to quash the proceedings in Crime No.240 of 2020 pending on the file of Railway Koduru Police Station, YSR Kadapa District, registered for the offences punishable under Sections 328, 273 r/w 34 of Indian Penal Code (for short \"I.P.C.\"), Section 5 of Cigarettes and Tobacco Products Act, 2003 and Section 50(1) of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners and the learned Public Prosecutor for the State of Andhra Pradesh submit that the issue involved in this petition is squarely covered by the order of this Court in Criminal Petition No.3731 of 2018 and batch dated 27.08.2018.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners and the learned Public Prosecutor for the State of Andhra Pradesh submit that the issue involved in this petition is squarely covered by the order of this Court in Criminal Petition No.3731 of 2018 and batch dated 27.08.2018.",
